<title>RUSSIA: Russia Sept non-CIS crude exports up, products sli.</title>
<headline>Russia Sept non-CIS crude exports up, products sli.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian crude oil exports outside the Commonwealth of Independent States rose in September to 9.34 million tonnes, while exports of refined products slipped, State Statistics Committee figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN NON-CIS ENERGY EXPORTS	Sept 1996	   Aug 1996</p>
<p> Crude oil (tonnes)			9,340,000	  8,995,000</p>
<p> Gasoline					321,000	    356,000</p>
<p> Diesel					1,265,000	  1,673,000</p>
<p> Heavy fuel oil (mazut)		  1,571,000	  1,814,000</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
